WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
One cloaked figure.

2
00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.100
Five coloured lenses.

3
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.610
Through the lens marked empire,
a railway timetable glows.

4
00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.240
Through money, a heap of coins.

5
00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.310
Through mother, a cradle.

6
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.180
Through desire, a crescent of a mouth.

7
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.590
Through women, a typewriter.

8
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:23.250
And back in 1897, the first
reviewers had verdicts of their own.

9
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.450
One vampire, five critics,
five different monsters.

10
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.580
So which reading is the right one?

11
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.340
In this mission, you'll trace how
readings of Dracula have changed,

12
00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.180
from 1897 to 1990.

13
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.800
And you'll look through each lens in turn:

14
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.710
empire, money, mothers and
women, and desire between men.

15
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.160
Your mission: decide which
reading is the right one.
